# Stage-0 screen list (polaris_makani_finetune_stability_handoff.md §2c), priority order.
# label=run_dir:ckpt   run_dir relative to $EXPROOT; ckpt relative to <run_dir>/training_checkpoints.
# A label ending _eNN is checked against the epoch stored in the checkpoint (summary column epoch_check).
# File->epoch mapping from write order (verified 2026-09-24 by mtime): ckpt_mp0_v<i> = epoch i+1 for
# c1_rollout_full_b16 (24 kept) and prod1n_b32_sgdr (243 kept); nf4_prod_b16_r1 keeps 4 rotating
# versions, v0..v3 = epochs 21..24; its best_ckpt = epoch 1.
#
# 1. C1 (depth 1) all 24 epochs vs B (depth 4) epochs 1, 21-24: matched batch 16, LR, schedule.
